From 59ef0f47b41fb99e5759f7320aa9c1c089e2fb6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Freimann <felix.freimann@mediatek.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 11:28:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] GENIO: remoteproc: add mtk_jh_rproc driver

Adds support for creating RPMsg channels to a Jailhouse inmate using the
standard Linux remoteproc attach operation.  The driver never loads
firmware and never starts the remote; it attaches to an already-running
inmate over the Jailhouse vPCI ivshmem-v2 device and provides the virtio
transport only.

Upstream-Status: Pending
