 drivers/remoteproc/Makefile       |   1 +
 drivers/remoteproc/mtk_jh_rproc.c | 807 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 822 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/remoteproc/mtk_jh_rproc.c

